# Only image recipes and explicitly safe custom resources enter the context.
# Private data/, configuration, and repository metadata are outside images/.
**
!.dockerignore
!base/
!base/Dockerfile
!base/pi-update-guard
!custom/
!custom/Dockerfile
!custom/entrypoint
!custom/AGENTS.md
!custom/skills/
!custom/skills/python-development/
!custom/skills/python-development/SKILL.md
